WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.983
Bird found a tree in the south.

2
00:00:10.984 --> 00:00:16.061
She hung up her bag.

3
00:00:16.062 --> 00:00:24.660
Then she started to build a nest.

4
00:00:24.661 --> 00:00:33.577
Soon a breeze blew through the tree.

5
00:00:33.578 --> 00:00:36.159
Bird's bag swung upside down.

6
00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:41.298
And Kip's lucky acorn fell out. Bonk!

7
00:00:41.299 --> 00:00:45.825
"Ouch!" said Bird. "Kip, please be careful with . . ."

8
00:00:45.826 --> 00:00:48.763
Bird looked up.

9
00:00:48.764 --> 00:00:56.650
"Silly me," she said. "Kip isn't here."

10
00:00:56.651 --> 00:00:59.780
Bird picked up Kip's lucky acorn.

11
00:00:59.781 --> 00:01:05.880
She started to feel a little sad.

12
00:01:05.881 --> 00:01:11.607
Kip was sad too.

13
00:01:11.608 --> 00:01:14.800
"I miss Bird," he said.

14
00:01:14.801 --> 00:01:23.754
"I'm not looking forward to winter anymore."

15
00:01:23.755 --> 00:01:27.915
Suddenly . . . Bonk!

16
00:01:27.916 --> 00:01:31.442
"My lucky acorn!" said Kip.

17
00:01:31.443 --> 00:01:36.703
He looked up.

18
00:01:36.704 --> 00:01:42.928
"Bird! You flew back!" he cried.

19
00:01:42.929 --> 00:01:46.563
"I thought birds flew south for the winter."

20
00:01:46.564 --> 00:01:49.716
"Other birds do that," said Bird.

21
00:01:49.717 --> 00:01:52.652
"I would rather stay right here."

22
00:01:52.653 --> 00:01:55.891
"With your friend," said Kip.

23
00:01:55.892 --> 00:01:59.748
"No," said Bird.

24
00:01:59.749 --> 00:02:11.535
"With my best friend."

